1
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,120
Song Yi.

2
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,320
- Hm?
- How much farther?

3
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,160
What's wrong?

4
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,560
Tired?

5
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,040
I'm not tired

6
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,960
but the way I am now

7
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:50,440
I can't see any of it, however beautiful.

8
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,800
Didn't you want to paint the sunrise?

9
00:00:52,846 --> 00:00:54,485
A sunrise is painted from life.

10
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,400
Would you have me paint it blind?

11
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,000
Besides

12
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,440
look at what time it is.

13
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,000
There's no sunrise to catch.

14
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,720
Heh.

15
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,500
We did miss the sunrise

16
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,399
but you can paint the sunset.

17
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,599
Or if all else fails

18
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:10,720
just paint the scenery.

19
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,720
So you really are making me paint blind.

20
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Come on.

21
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,640
It's not painting blind...

22
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,560
it's painting with your heart.

23
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,520
Painting with…

24
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,840
with my heart?

25
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,760
You'll see in a bit.

26
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Mm.

27
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,160
Song Yi.

28
00:01:40,579 --> 00:01:41,579
There yet?

29
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:43,940
Yeah.

30
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,560
We're here.

31
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:51,039
The wind's really strong here.

32
00:01:53,365 --> 00:01:54,365
Here.

33
00:01:54,566 --> 00:01:55,566
Come here to me.

34
00:02:12,406 --> 00:02:13,446
Give me your hand.

35
00:02:16,126 --> 00:02:16,966
Let me

36
00:02:16,967 --> 00:02:18,126
help you paint.

37
00:02:19,566 --> 00:02:20,566
Mm.

38
00:02:23,726 --> 00:02:24,726
In the distance

39
00:02:25,246 --> 00:02:27,366
there's a long range of mountains.

40
00:02:28,566 --> 00:02:30,046
At the foot of the mountains

41
00:02:30,886 --> 00:02:32,246
there's a village.

42
00:02:34,166 --> 00:02:35,646
And through the village

43
00:02:36,006 --> 00:02:37,886
a winding river flows.

44
00:02:42,006 --> 00:02:43,726
And this patch on the left

45
00:02:44,566 --> 00:02:46,806
is a grove of snow-covered cedars.

46
00:02:48,966 --> 00:02:51,366
Even in this season, there's still snow.

47
00:02:53,046 --> 00:02:54,646
The altitude's high here.

48
00:03:05,359 --> 00:03:06,159
And here.

49
00:03:07,232 --> 00:03:08,792
Imagine a sunset.

50
00:03:13,636 --> 00:03:16,126
The sunset
is stained red

51
00:03:17,303 --> 00:03:18,782
just like

52
00:03:18,783 --> 00:03:20,743
a perfectly ripe cherry tomato.

53
00:03:22,856 --> 00:03:24,776
Nobody describes a sunset like that.

54
00:03:27,989 --> 00:03:29,789
Because I love to eat, that's why.

55
00:03:37,863 --> 00:03:38,863
Look over here.

56
00:03:39,703 --> 00:03:42,383
Ridge after ridge of mountains

57
00:03:43,103 --> 00:03:44,782
and the sunlight

58
00:03:44,783 --> 00:03:48,609
paints them layer by layer
in lines of gold.

59
00:03:51,983 --> 00:03:52,983
It's beautiful.

60
00:04:07,903 --> 00:04:08,943
What's this?

61
00:04:09,983 --> 00:04:12,023
Um... the sunset?

62
00:04:13,383 --> 00:04:14,383
Correct.

63
00:04:23,783 --> 00:04:25,783
What did you draw left of the sun?

64
00:04:27,503 --> 00:04:28,743
I drew you.

65
00:04:31,943 --> 00:04:33,183
Then...

66
00:04:34,583 --> 00:04:35,583
Then...

67
00:04:43,903 --> 00:04:45,582
then this one on the right

68
00:04:45,583 --> 00:04:46,703
has to be you.

69
00:05:54,409 --> 00:05:55,529
Goodbye, Xu Feiyu.

70
00:05:56,449 --> 00:05:58,129
I accepted your mother's request

71
00:05:59,143 --> 00:06:01,183
to leave me in a world you can't see.

72
00:06:02,623 --> 00:06:03,703
Perhaps she was right,

73
00:06:04,783 --> 00:06:07,863
perhaps time will prove everything.

74
00:06:54,063 --> 00:06:55,342
Don't be nervous

75
00:06:55,343 --> 00:06:56,663
don't rush it,

76
00:06:57,543 --> 00:07:00,263
open your eyes slowly.

77
00:07:22,383 --> 00:07:23,742
How does it feel?

78
00:07:23,743 --> 00:07:24,743
Son.

79
00:07:25,303 --> 00:07:26,903
Is everything in focus?

80
00:07:28,743 --> 00:07:29,743
Yes

81
00:07:30,063 --> 00:07:31,063
I can see clearly.

82
00:07:31,064 --> 00:07:32,102
Oh

83
00:07:32,103 --> 00:07:33,103
that's wonderful.

84
00:07:33,104 --> 00:07:34,622
Thank you, Doctor!

85
00:07:34,623 --> 00:07:35,623
You're welcome.

86
00:07:35,624 --> 00:07:37,103
Once you're outside

87
00:07:37,343 --> 00:07:39,182
try to keep his eyes

88
00:07:39,183 --> 00:07:40,622
on things far away.

89
00:07:40,623 --> 00:07:43,383
It'll help him adjust.

90
00:07:43,583 --> 00:07:44,583
All right.

91
00:07:45,503 --> 00:07:46,942
Take this medicine home

92
00:07:46,943 --> 00:07:48,303
have him take it on time.

93
00:07:49,503 --> 00:07:50,743
Get well soon.

94
00:07:51,343 --> 00:07:52,263
Okay.

95
00:07:52,263 --> 00:07:53,263
Thank you, Doctor.

96
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:59,339
[Doctors are kindhearted,
love without borders]

97
00:09:06,783 --> 00:09:07,223
Honestly

98
00:09:07,543 --> 00:09:08,543
you two

99
00:09:08,783 --> 00:09:10,423
had me worried sick.

100
00:09:11,783 --> 00:09:13,383
Everything's fine, isn't it?

101
00:09:15,663 --> 00:09:17,662
How did you convince Xu Yun

102
00:09:17,663 --> 00:09:20,143
to let you see Feiyu after
the bandages came off?

103
00:09:21,503 --> 00:09:23,182
With the thing she does best.

104
00:09:23,183 --> 00:09:24,183
What?

105
00:09:26,463 --> 00:09:27,463
"A deal."

106
00:09:27,983 --> 00:09:29,063
Oh.

107
00:09:30,063 --> 00:09:32,583
No wonder she told
me you two had settled it.

108
00:09:33,503 --> 00:09:36,022
But the terms of that
deal are a little too...

109
00:09:36,023 --> 00:09:37,142
A little too cold?

110
00:09:37,143 --> 00:09:37,783
Exactly.

111
00:09:37,903 --> 00:09:39,542
She even made you switch numbers,

112
00:09:39,543 --> 00:09:40,543
wiped every contact,

113
00:09:40,544 --> 00:09:42,143
erased every trace.

114
00:09:42,663 --> 00:09:43,663
Cold.

115
00:09:45,703 --> 00:09:47,223
She really is ruthless.

116
00:09:47,783 --> 00:09:49,143
As cold as ten years ago.

117
00:09:51,903 --> 00:09:53,903
Why do you have to go this far?

118
00:09:56,943 --> 00:09:58,943
Xu Feiyu and I made a promise.

119
00:10:00,543 --> 00:10:02,143
On the day the bandages came off

120
00:10:02,863 --> 00:10:04,303
he'd see what I look like.

121
00:10:05,663 --> 00:10:07,103
Doing it this way today

122
00:10:08,303 --> 00:10:10,382
keeps the promise I made to him

123
00:10:10,383 --> 00:10:11,502
without breaking

124
00:10:11,503 --> 00:10:13,183
my deal with Auntie Xu.

125
00:10:18,383 --> 00:10:21,143
Can you… really forget Feiyu?

126
00:10:26,943 --> 00:10:27,943
I don't know.

127
00:10:29,103 --> 00:10:30,543
Looks like...

128
00:10:30,983 --> 00:10:32,303
I don't get a choice either.

129
00:10:59,143 --> 00:11:00,863
Give him back the puzzle and this.

130
00:11:01,663 --> 00:11:02,663
I'm quitting smoking.

131
00:11:05,383 --> 00:11:06,863
Nothing to remember him by?

132
00:11:08,983 --> 00:11:09,983
Nothing.

133
00:11:34,983 --> 00:11:35,983
Don't move.

134
00:11:39,743 --> 00:11:40,743
Mom.

135
00:11:40,783 --> 00:11:42,582
What are you doing?

136
00:11:42,583 --> 00:11:42,863
Shh.

137
00:11:43,223 --> 00:11:44,223
Quiet.

138
00:11:50,183 --> 00:11:52,342
Isn't this a bit much?

139
00:11:52,343 --> 00:11:53,783
Better safe than sorry.

140
00:11:54,783 --> 00:11:56,422
All the bad luck you had

141
00:11:56,423 --> 00:11:57,383
while you were sick

142
00:11:57,383 --> 00:11:58,303
burn it all

143
00:11:58,303 --> 00:11:59,303
toss it behind you!

144
00:11:59,583 --> 00:12:00,662
Now do as I say.

145
00:12:00,663 --> 00:12:01,183
Step over.

146
00:12:01,463 --> 00:12:02,463
Fine.

147
00:12:05,743 --> 00:12:06,823
Happy now?

148
00:12:08,183 --> 00:12:09,783
Go put on some new clothes.

149
00:12:22,783 --> 00:12:23,783
Ah.

150
00:12:32,983 --> 00:12:35,103
Sorry, the number you dialed
does not exist,

151
00:12:36,063 --> 00:12:37,743
Please check it and redial.

152
00:12:38,583 --> 00:12:41,703
Sorry, the number you
dialed does not exist.

153
00:12:42,143 --> 00:12:43,823
Please check it and redial.

154
00:12:50,623 --> 00:12:52,743
Sorry, the number you dialed
does not exist,

155
00:12:53,743 --> 00:12:55,423
Please check it and redial.

156
00:12:56,263 --> 00:12:57,263
Sorry.

157
00:13:01,663 --> 00:13:02,823
How do you feel?

158
00:13:03,143 --> 00:13:04,343
Feeling better?

159
00:13:05,143 --> 00:13:06,143
Yeah

160
00:13:06,263 --> 00:13:06,903
I'm fine now

161
00:13:07,183 --> 00:13:08,943
I'm calling Song Yi.

162
00:13:14,863 --> 00:13:16,543
He said

163
00:13:17,743 --> 00:13:19,863
to give you this before he left.

164
00:13:33,263 --> 00:13:34,423
Song Yi's?

165
00:13:38,783 --> 00:13:40,543
He said he's quit smoking.

166
00:13:42,583 --> 00:13:44,463
Then why did he change his number too?

167
00:13:45,583 --> 00:13:47,303
That I don't know.

168
00:13:49,183 --> 00:13:51,702
He got that number here

169
00:13:51,703 --> 00:13:53,502
and he's back in Singapore

170
00:13:53,503 --> 00:13:54,702
so of course it doesn't work.

171
00:13:54,703 --> 00:13:55,983
It's not normal!

172
00:13:56,263 --> 00:13:57,383
What's his new number?

173
00:13:58,263 --> 00:13:59,743
Why didn't he tell me?

174
00:14:02,543 --> 00:14:03,943
That's…

175
00:14:07,263 --> 00:14:08,663
Did he tell you?

176
00:14:11,263 --> 00:14:12,383
No.

177
00:14:16,983 --> 00:14:18,343
Any other way to reach him?

178
00:14:23,463 --> 00:14:25,463
Right… there's WeChat!

179
00:14:30,383 --> 00:14:31,903
I never added him on WeChat.

180
00:14:33,183 --> 00:14:34,183
What about yours?

181
00:14:34,383 --> 00:14:35,063
Let me see!

182
00:14:35,064 --> 00:14:37,022
I… I don't have it either.

183
00:14:37,023 --> 00:14:38,303
Show me!

184
00:14:38,583 --> 00:14:39,783
See for yourself.

185
00:15:06,703 --> 00:15:07,703
He…

186
00:15:09,223 --> 00:15:11,503
I don't know what he looks like.

187
00:15:13,903 --> 00:15:15,743
No way to contact him.

188
00:15:18,303 --> 00:15:20,383
All I know is he came from Singapore.

189
00:15:27,183 --> 00:15:29,383
Is he someone who doesn't exist?

190
00:15:32,583 --> 00:15:33,583
No.

191
00:15:37,463 --> 00:15:38,463
That's not right.

192
00:15:39,263 --> 00:15:41,383
Didn't you used to work at his house?

193
00:15:45,343 --> 00:15:48,543
That was back when I was in college.

194
00:15:49,183 --> 00:15:50,742
That was years ago.

195
00:15:50,743 --> 00:15:52,663
That street's probably gone by now.

196
00:15:54,303 --> 00:15:55,703
No way to reach him at all?

197
00:15:58,463 --> 00:15:59,543
No.

198
00:16:10,863 --> 00:16:12,863
Then he planned this from the start
